  "description": "<h3 data-end=\"466\" data-start=\"441\"><strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"445\">About the Brand</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"772\" data-start=\"467\"><em data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"467\">A Good Night Sleep</em> is a premium Australian brand dedicated to helping women embrace self-love, confidence, and beauty through the power of restful, luxurious sleep. Co-founded by Jadie Gup and her mother, Ying, the brand is built on a mission to empower one million women to wake up feeling like queens.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"774\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"801\" data-start=\"779\"><strong data-end=\"799\" data-start=\"783\">Our Products</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1109\" data-start=\"802\">We offer a curated range of <strong data-end=\"860\" data-start=\"830\">100% premium Mulberry silk</strong> sleep products, including silk pillowcases, sleep masks, sleep caps (turbans and bonnets), silk scrunchies, and more. Designed to elevate sleep and beauty routines, our products help reduce frizz, prevent aging, and support healthier hair and skin.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1114\" data-start=\"1111\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1156\" data-start=\"1116\"><strong data-end=\"1154\" data-start=\"1120\">Why Partner With Us (Our Edge)</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1157\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1157\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1194\" data-start=\"1159\">Female-founded, mission-led brand</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1229\" data-start=\"1195\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1229\" data-start=\"1197\">Premium Mulberry silk products</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1230\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1271\" data-start=\"1232\">Targeting professional women aged 40+</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1272\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1306\" data-start=\"1274\">Trusted and expanding globally</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1307\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1341\" data-start=\"1309\">1% of profits donated to charity</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1346\" data-start=\"1343\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1388\" data-start=\"1348\"><strong data-end=\"1386\" data-start=\"1352\">Affiliate Commission &amp; Rewards</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1571\" data-start=\"1389\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1432\" data-start=\"1389\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1432\" data-start=\"1391\"><strong data-end=\"1409\" data-start=\"1391\">12% commission</strong> on orders under $500</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1433\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1471\" data-start=\"1435\"><strong data-end=\"1453\" data-start=\"1435\">15% commission</strong> on orders $500+</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1546\" data-start=\"1472\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1546\" data-start=\"1474\"><strong data-end=\"1484\" data-start=\"1474\">Bonus:</strong> Every 100 referrals = <strong data-end=\"1544\" data-start=\"1507\">$150 A Good Night Sleep gift card</strong></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1571\" data-start=\"1547\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1571\" data-start=\"1549\">Payouts issued monthly</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<hr data-end=\"1576\" data-start=\"1573\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1607\" data-start=\"1578\"><strong data-end=\"1605\" data-start=\"1582\">Support &amp; Resources</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"1785\" data-start=\"1608\">We offer marketing materials, exclusive product previews, and personalized support to help you grow with us. Join a movement that&rsquo;s redefining beauty sleep for women everywhere.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"466\" data-start=\"441\"><strong data-end=\"464\" data-start=\"445\">About the Brand</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"772\" data-start=\"467\"><em data-end=\"487\" data-start=\"467\">A Good Night Sleep</em> is a premium Australian brand dedicated to helping women embrace self-love, confidence, and beauty through the power of restful, luxurious sleep. Co-founded by Jadie Gup and her mother, Ying, the brand is built on a mission to empower one million women to wake up feeling like queens.</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"777\" data-start=\"774\">\r\n